+# Independent MaxRebatePayout derivation
+
+Only author-provided max-rebate.mori and max-rebate.scenario.json were read for this case. No author's new tests, expected outputs, numeric recipe, patch or actual result was read. Actual source route is beta/1 to explicit Source6, not mori-core/1 or a backendArtifact; the historical directory name supplies no qualification.
+
+USD aliases economicassetA at scale2 inMidnight. Buyer/Seller/Treasury aliasOwner/Recipient/Fee. 4.50USD=450atoms; atoms(USD,50)=50, so subtraction450-50=400Qty. Leftscalar2*400=800Qty. The other maxargument7.00USD=700, therefore max(a800,b700)=800 choosesa. Feeatoms25 is25, independent of decimal display. Gross800+25=825, grosscap8.50USD=850, feecap25, netfloor800, capheadroom25. The owner pays825; recipient's netincrease is800, fee recipient's increase25. No double fee subtraction, rounding, conversion or floatingpoint arithmetic.
+
+Openingbalances Owner2000/Recipient5/Fee7 become1175/805/32; allowance remaining2000/spent25 becomes1175/850. All provided balances total2012 before/after, and allowance remaining+spent totals2025. These are finite arithmetic cross-checks, not a conservation/security proof or observed acceptance. No obligation is supplied or permitted in this transfer input; no duty creation/discharge occurs and retainedduties is explicitlyempty, without claiming any global ledgerdebt inventory.
+
+Exact ordered effects: DebitOwner825, CreditRecipient800, CreditFee25, UseAllowanceOwner825, UseReplay, AdvanceHeadm0->m1. A positivefee retains itsCredit in position3. The seven conditional financial prefix frames cover initial state and every effect, retaining all provided cells. The replay effect is bare rebate-nonce in Source6; Core5semantic vector uses encoded[Midnight,Owner,rebate-nonce]. Authenticated.predecessor rebate-opening is distinct from AdvanceHead's predecessorm0. Round4 does not advance. These are mathematical effect prefixes, not evaluator traces or work charges.
+
+The full Source6Ast and every target statement/block are independently mapped from the pinned grammar/DTO definitions. selected.actionId is TransferLiteralFee, not pay_rebate. Work12/2 is merely transported inSource6. LOGICAL-WORK-ASSUMPTIONS.json selects no actual rate or postwork; UNKNOWN.json retains wholeProgram/Artifact/hashes/gates/qualification and actualbyte/meters/state boundaries.
+
+Prior implementation exposure is disclosed: this author prepared earlier Corefinancial/report and Source6 CLI/library/emitter/checker/source-owner packets and the separate capped-remittance oracle. This is not globalblindness. Current derivation used only these newinputfiles and normative/DTOdefinitions; no evaluator/compiler/provider/SDK/product execution, Git query/mutation, or shared write occurred. Kstartup skill/AGENTS/product/status was restored read-only. No Q1providerloop was restarted.
